8. Succinctly, contentions raised before me are that :
(a) The learned Tribunal has not considered the site plan which categori- cally proves that the deceased was a pillion rider and respondent No. 1 was driving the motor cycle;
(b) The learned Tribunal has misread the evidence of PWs 1, 2 and 3, who deposed regarding the manner of the accident and the negligence of respondent No. 1;
